

BOT AND MESSAGING INTEGRATION NOTICE
-------------------------------------
The optional Signal Bot Center is an outbound notification feature. It supports
user-owned Telegram Bot API credentials, Discord incoming webhook URLs, and the
official WhatsApp Business Cloud API. It does not automate personal WhatsApp
accounts, scrape private chats, bypass platform controls, or execute trades.

Bot messages are generated from application data and should be treated as
informational. The application does not guarantee delivery, ordering, latency,
rate-limit availability, or retention by Telegram, Discord, Meta, or any other
provider. Provider terms, message policies, opt-in requirements, templates,
recipient permissions, and applicable laws remain the user's responsibility.
Credentials are stored locally using Android Keystore-backed encryption and are
never intended to be committed to source control. Users should revoke a token
or webhook immediately if a device is compromised.
